  "description": "A community-driven Foundry VTT game system for Deadlands Classic (Weird West). Features exploding dice (Aces), poker-card initiative, Fate Chips (White/Red/Blue/Legend) and location-based wounds. No rulebook content is included — you supply your own Edges, Hindrances and Hexes, or install the optional companion content module. Unofficial fan project: Deadlands is a trademark of Pinnacle Entertainment Group, and this system is not affiliated with or endorsed by Pinnacle.",
